],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 on the middle, November to December landed at 46% of normal while May to June hit 159%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 58% of normal on the middle. Every grid in the table had its driest year in 2007, with grid 17881 down at 57%.</p>"}
